{"method":{"methodHash":"d385514e1ba520757553ff73a272538f","typeHash":"b81c0d0390b2627546ac203aadc9f4c4","name":"RotateGradientBasedOnMouse","filePath":"/Users/pratiksinghthakur/perproj/dotnet/Aimmy/Aimmy2/Other/ThemeManager.cs","bodySpan":{"startLine":489,"startColumn":9,"endLine":506,"endColumn":10},"calls":[{"span":{"startLine":495,"startColumn":43,"endLine":495,"endColumn":109},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"FirstOrDefault"},{"span":{"startLine":495,"startColumn":43,"endLine":495,"endColumn":92},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"OfType\u003CRotateTransform\u003E"},{"span":{"startLine":498,"startColumn":40,"endLine":498,"endColumn":61},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"GetPosition"},{"span":{"startLine":501,"startColumn":40,"endLine":501,"endColumn":94},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Atan2"}]},"lines":["        public static void RotateGradientBasedOnMouse(object sender, MouseEventArgs e)","        {","            if (sender is Border border \u0026\u0026 border.Background is LinearGradientBrush gradientBrush)","            {","                if (gradientBrush.RelativeTransform is TransformGroup transformGroup)","                {","                    var rotateTransform = transformGroup.Children.OfType\u003CRotateTransform\u003E().FirstOrDefault();","                    if (rotateTransform != null)","                    {","                        var mousePos = e.GetPosition(border);","                        var centerX = border.ActualWidth / 2;","                        var centerY = border.ActualHeight / 2;","                        double angle = Math.Atan2(mousePos.Y - centerY, mousePos.X - centerX) * (180 / Math.PI);","                        rotateTransform.Angle = angle;","                    }","                }","            }","        }"],"startLine":489}